   "rationale": "The caller registers NISTu203 cwt (UK). Under 2.2.0 data NISTu230 cwt (US) rooted on NISTu203, so the UK registration leaked into the US unit (2 cwt (US) = 100 kg). Under the candidate NISTu230 roots on hecto-NISTu201 (lb); lb has no conversion in UnitsDB and no registration here, so the request is refused. Now agrees with unitsml-ruby (refusal)."
